               *
----------------------------------
p q # (p | !q) ->: (p & q)
----------------------------------
T T #    T F   T      T
T F #    T T   F      F
F T #    F F   T      F
F F #    T T   F      F
----------------------------------


Contingent
T: [T T] [F T]
F: [T F] [F F]